WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Linda Park: First-pass yield on Line 3 moved up to ninety-two point one percent this week.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Carlos Ibarra: That's mostly from the torque spec fix at Station 7, seal leaks are still the biggest remaining category.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Theo Marsh: What's the plan to tackle the seal leak defects specifically?

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Carlos Ibarra: We're trialing a revised gasket seating pressure on two cells starting Monday.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Grace Liu: I'll make sure the floor supervisors flag any related quality holds separately so we can isolate the trial data.
